<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<style>
  @page {
    size: A4;
    margin: 15mm 12mm;
    background-color: #faf8f5;
  }
  *, *::before, *::after {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }
  body {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    color: #2c3e50;
    font-size: 10pt;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: 20pt;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: #1a252f;
    margin: 0 0 4px 0;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
  }
  .contact-info {
    font-size: 9pt;
    color: #555;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    border-bottom: 2px solid #34495e;
    padding-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .contact-info span {
    margin-right: 15px;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: 12pt;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: #2c3e50;
    margin: 14px 0 6px 0;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    border-left: 4px solid #3498db;
    padding-left: 6px;
    letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    page-break-after: avoid;
  }
  .summary-text {
    margin: 0 0 10px 0;
    text-align: justify;
    color: #34495e;
  }
  .section {
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .item {
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    page-break-inside: avoid;
  }
  .item-header {
    display: block;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: #2c3e50;
  }
  .item-sub {
    font-style: italic;
    color: #7f8c8d;
    font-size: 9.5pt;
  }
  ul {
    margin: 4px 0 0 16px;
    padding: 0;
  }
  li {
    margin-bottom: 3px;
    color: #34495e;
  }
  .skills-grid {
    margin-top: 4px;
  }
  .skills-category {
    font-weight: bold;
    color: #2c3e50;
    display: inline;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

  <h1>Ayushman Banerjee</h1>
  <div class="contact-info">
    <span>Durgapur, West Bengal, India</span> | 
    <span>banerjeeayushman280405@gmail.com</span> | 
    <span>9332834548</span> | 
    <span>github.com/Ayushman2804</span> | 
    <span>linkedin.com/in/ayushman-banerjee-07b625319</span>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <h2>Professional Summary</h2>
    <p class="summary-text">
      Final-year Computer Science and Engineering student at KIIT University with a strong focus on Generative AI, large language model ecosystems, RAG architectures, and AI agent frameworks. Experienced in designing, developing, and deploying production-ready AI pipelines, vector database integrations, and robust backend services using Python, LangChain, FAISS, FastAPI, and Docker. Deeply passionate about modern LLM ecosystems, fine-tuning foundation models, and building scalable AI solutions that solve real-world problems.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <h2>Technical Skills</h2>
    <div class="skills-grid">
      <div class="item"><span class="skills-category">Core & Languages:</span> Python, SQL, Data Structures & Algorithms</div>
      <div class="item"><span class="skills-category">Generative AI & LLMs:</span> LangChain, LlamaIndex, HuggingFace Transformers, Sentence Transformers, RAG Pipelines, Vector Databases (FAISS, Pinecone, Weaviate), Prompt Engineering, Fine-Tuning, AI Agents, GPT, LLaMA, Gemini, Claude</div>
      <div class="item"><span class="skills-category">Backend & Frameworks:</span> FastAPI, Streamlit, Plotly Dash, React, Vite, spaCy, scikit-learn, XGBoost, LSTM (PyTorch)</div>
      <div class="item"><span class="skills-category">Cloud, DevOps & MLOps:</span> Docker, Kubernetes, CI/CD, Git/GitHub, Google Cloud Platform (GCP), Cloud Run, GKE, MLflow, Weights & Biases, Vercel, Render</div>
      <div class="item"><span class="skills-category">Testing & Tools:</span> Pytest, Playwright, Selenium, Postman, Kafka, Reddit API, Matplotlib, Seaborn</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <h2>Key AI & Software Projects</h2>
    
    <div class="item">
      <span class="item-header">RAG Document Q&A System</span>
      <ul>
        <li>Built an advanced retrieval-augmented generation system using LangChain, Hugging Face Transformers, and FAISS for semantic document search, context retrieval, and precise question answering.</li>
        <li>Implemented custom prompt templates, chunking strategies, and vector store integrations to optimize output reliability and minimize hallucination.</li>
        <li>Developed an intuitive Streamlit interface with robust error handling and cross-platform compatibility.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="item">
      <span class="item-header">Real-Time Sentiment Analysis & AI Pipeline Dashboard</span>
      <ul>
        <li>Developed a real-time data ingestion and sentiment analysis pipeline utilizing Reddit API, Kafka, and HuggingFace transformer models.</li>
        <li>Exposed backend inference via FastAPI microservices and built a live Streamlit dashboard for real-time visualization of sentiment trends and LLM outputs.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="item">
      <span class="item-header">OTT Platform Monetization & Machine Learning Analysis</span>
      <ul>
        <li>Engineered ML models (Random Forest, XGBoost, Logistic Regression) to analyze customer churn, revenue streams, and behavioral segmentation.</li>
        <li>Built a full-stack application with a React/Vite frontend and FastAPI backend, containerized with Docker, and deployed on Vercel and Render.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="item">
      <span class="item-header">Resume / Job Description Matcher & Semantic Scoring Tool</span>
      <ul>
        <li>Created a semantic matching tool using SentenceTransformers, spaCy, and TF-IDF to calculate semantic similarity scores between resumes and job descriptions, streamlining automated screening workflows.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="item">
      <span class="item-header">Time Series Forecasting Application</span>
      <ul>
        <li>Implemented and benchmarked ARIMA, Prophet, and LSTM (PyTorch) models for predictive time series analysis, visualized with interactive Plotly Dash components.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <h2>Certifications</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Google Cloud Generative AI Learning Path</strong> – Google Cloud</li>
      <li><strong>IBM AI/ML Certification</strong> – IBM</li>
      <li><strong>London Business School Certificate Program</strong> – London Business School</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <h2>Education</h2>
    <div class="item">
      <span class="item-header">Kalinga Institute of Industrial Technology (KIIT), Bhubaneswar</span>
      <span class="item-sub">B.Tech in Computer Science and Engineering | Expected Graduation: 2026</span>
    </div>
  </div>

</body>
</html>